  message: <<EOM
zfs_rebase must run as root, and keeps each rebase in its own 0700
directory under /var/db/zfs_rebase, which it makes as it needs it. A
rebase left at a gate is meant to be picked up again: --continue
resumes it, --abort takes it away, and until one of those it holds its
input snapshots so nothing can destroy them.

It was built against the OpenZFS headers of the source tree in
SRC_BASE, so it expects the ZFS the system was built with. Rebuild it
after a source upgrade.

It never promotes. The clone form leaves a read-only clone for you to
promote, rename or inherit by hand. See zfs_rebase(8).
EOM
}
